{{infobox creature|||baseq=10|hp=900|fhp=N/A|loot=[[Ant Crown]], [[Ant Chitin]] x10, [[Ant Queen's Wings]], [[Entrails]] x8, [[Big Brain]], [[Ant Meat]] x30}}The Giant Ant Queen is the ultimate boss of an [[Ant Hill Dungeon|Ant Hill Dungeon.]] She is the general commander of the hill and is protected by her daughters in arms.

She is only found in the final room of the dungeon, her arena, which can only be accessed by placing the "Special Key", found randomly in the dungeon, on the "Special Stand" which is found in the room previous.

Defeating her will: 

* Yield everyone in the dungeon (not just those fighting her) the [[Experience Event]] "Sundering the Hill" which grants a permanent speed bonus to raiding anthills.
* Drop a [[Small Heart Container]] in her arena.
* Spawn a new exit to the dungeon in her arena.
* Cause the dungeon to begin shaking, which will destroy it (and render all loot, the Queen or her minion's corpses, the Small Heart Container, any objects you built or brought into the dungeon, even ''tamed animals like your horse'' inside lost forever) in 5 minutes or when all Hearthlings leave.

The Ant Queen's damage and health is slightly random; or more specifically is connected to the dungeon's invisible "[[Dungeon|difficulty]]" stat that all dungeons randomly roll.

Additionally she will not flee no matter how much damage she takes.

== Combat ==
The Ant Queen can attack with her jaws and claws as well as spit acid. Ant Spit penetrates all armor as usual. She has access to various high tier animal moves.

=== Behaviour ===
As with all dungeon enemies, she is extremely aggressive in a aggro range that is moderate but not as large as yours. If she aggroes you, she can (but is not guaranteed to) additionally call all nearby enemies to aggro you as well. However, if you aggro her yourself, she will not call her allies.

Naturally, she cannot aggro you through walls or objects, so use them to your advantage to gain angles where you can aggro her, but her minions can't aggro you.

